ready: 1
kind: constant
id: retention.const.idle-windows
module: retention
name: IDLE_WINDOWS
description: How many days of no use bring each kind of memory from full strength to forgotten, before salience extends the window.
table:
  columns: [kind, days]
  rows:
    - [episode, "180"]
    - [note, "180"]
    - [belief, "365"]
    - [goal, "365"]
    - [drive, "365"]
    - [relationship, "365"]
    - [playbook, "365"]
    - [guardrail, "365"]
    - [entity model, "365"]
    - [value, never]
    - [self-narrative, never]
notes: Owners and agents change the windows with the decay configuration call; the table holds the defaults.
